{"id":"62fc4eb5c29a689d","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-prikry-seq-uncountable.md","title":"Prikry Sequence is Countable and Cofinal","display":"thm-prikry-seq-uncountable — Prikry Sequence is Countable and Cofinal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-prikry-seq-uncountable","aliases":["58-thm-prikry-seq-uncountable"],"display":"thm-prikry-seq-uncountable — Prikry Sequence is Countable and Cofinal","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-prikry.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-prikry-seq-uncountable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-prikry-seq-uncountable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-prikry-seq-uncountable — Prikry Sequence is Countable and Cofinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6ccd6f7d977ed72\" href=\"?note=a6ccd6f7d977ed72\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-prikry.md\">../batch15/58-df-prikry.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b4fb7c1808c84d14\" href=\"?note=b4fb7c1808c84d14\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md\">../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e059389c097fae1\" href=\"?note=2e059389c097fae1\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"03675b0df2f4ca9a\" href=\"?note=03675b0df2f4ca9a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model.md\">58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-prikry-seq-uncountable-—-Prikry-Sequence-Uncountable\">thm-prikry-seq-uncountable — Prikry Sequence Uncountable</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (transitive ground model), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,U\\in M\">\\(\\kappa,U\\in M\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q_U=\\langle\\mathbb P_U,\\leq_{\\mathbb P_U}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb Q_U=\\langle\\mathbb P_U,\\leq_{\\mathbb P_U}\\rangle\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq\\mathbb P_U\">\\(G\\subseteq\\mathbb P_U\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-generic filter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (Prikry generic sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (upstream predicates and cofinality function), with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> denoting satisfaction in the generic extension</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}seq\\text{-}uncountable} \\vdash \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land\\kappa,U\\in M\\land\\mathbb Q_U=\\langle\\mathbb P_U,\\leq_{\\mathbb P_U}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S(G,M,\\mathbb Q_U)\\land S=\\bigcup\\{s\\in\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\\mid\\exists A\\in V\\;(\\langle s,A\\rangle\\in G)\\}\\to \\mathrm{Function}(S,\\omega,\\kappa)\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m&lt;n\\to S(m)&lt;S(n))\\land\\sup\\operatorname{ran}(S)=\\kappa\\land M[G]\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)=\\omega\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}seq\\text{-}uncountable} \\vdash \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land\\kappa,U\\in M\\land\\mathbb Q_U=\\langle\\mathbb P_U,\\leq_{\\mathbb P_U}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S(G,M,\\mathbb Q_U)\\land S=\\bigcup\\{s\\in\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\\mid\\exists A\\in V\\;(\\langle s,A\\rangle\\in G)\\}\\to \\mathrm{Function}(S,\\omega,\\kappa)\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m&lt;n\\to S(m)&lt;S(n))\\land\\sup\\operatorname{ran}(S)=\\kappa\\land M[G]\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)=\\omega\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Despite the historical filename, the generic sequence is countable; it changes the cofinality of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The sequence is reconstructed from the stems in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>; the genericity predicate receives the required poset code rather than the forcing carrier alone, and the extension's cofinality assertion is explicitly metatheoretic.</li>\n<li>Prikry forcing adds no bounded subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> and preserves cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-prikry-seq-uncountable-—-Prikry-Sequence-Uncountable","text":"thm-prikry-seq-uncountable — Prikry Sequence Uncountable","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-prikry.md","status":"resolved","id":"a6ccd6f7d977ed72","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-prikry.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"b4fb7c1808c84d14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e059389c097fae1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"03675b0df2f4ca9a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa,U\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q_U=\\langle\\mathbb P_U,\\leq_{\\mathbb P_U}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq\\mathbb P_U","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}prikry\\text{-}seq\\text{-}uncountable} \\vdash \\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land\\kappa,U\\in M\\land\\mathbb Q_U=\\langle\\mathbb P_U,\\leq_{\\mathbb P_U}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S(G,M,\\mathbb Q_U)\\land S=\\bigcup\\{s\\in\\kappa^{<\\omega}\\mid\\exists A\\in V\\;(\\langle s,A\\rangle\\in G)\\}\\to \\mathrm{Function}(S,\\omega,\\kappa)\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m<n\\to S(m)<S(n))\\land\\sup\\operatorname{ran}(S)=\\kappa\\land M[G]\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)=\\omega","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1982,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4369","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-prikry-seq-uncountable.md|58-thm-prikry-seq-uncountable]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a6ccd6f7d977ed72","b4fb7c1808c84d14","2e059389c097fae1","03675b0df2f4ca9a","315ad00b8744fdfc","36d7463d215be751"]}